    "sections": {
        "description": "Blog Grow is a clean, editorial WordPress theme for news sites, magazines and personal blogs. It ships with a featured posts hero, a breaking news ticker, category sections for the homepage, grid, list, classic and masonry blog layouts, a dark mode toggle, reading progress bar, share buttons, author box, related posts and up to four footer widget columns. Colors, fonts, container width and every section can be changed live in the Customizer, and the bundled DM Sans and DM Mono fonts load from your own site."
    },
